Package: pve-cloudinit-extras
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 9),
         libjson-perl,
         libtemplate-perl,
         perl,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: custom files, commands and include for the Proxmox VE Cloud-Init tab
 Adds "Custom files" (cicustom), "Commands" (runcmd), "Boot commands"
 (bootcmd) and "Include" (snippet or URL) rows to the VM Cloud-Init panel.
 Commands and Include are written into one generated per-VM vendor-data
 snippet by a small API endpoint.
 .
 The GUI and API hooks are marker lines in two pve-manager files. dpkg
 triggers re-apply them after pve-manager upgrades; untested pve-manager
 versions are left stock, and removal restores the files exactly.
